uji-dushu:unit038:m0239","start":239,"end":242,"surface":"程征北","kind":"person","person_id":"a42_j01_n4k","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本章程申伯/程征北與青州田園讓事；已讀固定026田豫國讓及青州刺史程喜構陷之完整單元，確切共同事件而非同名猜。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit038","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit038:m0265","start":265,"end":266,"surface":"喜","kind":"person","person_id":"a42_j01_n4k","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本章程申伯/程征北與青州田園讓事；已讀固定026田豫國讓及青州刺史程喜構陷之完整單元，確切共同事件而非同名猜。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit038","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037","text_layer":"received_chapter","text":"起家為河東太守嵗餘遷淮北都督䕶軍復以疾去恕所在務存大體而已其樹惠愛益得百姓歡心不及於畿頃之拜御史中丞恕在朝廷以不得當世之和故屢在外任復出為幽州刺史加建威將軍使持節䕶烏丸校尉時征北將軍程喜屯薊尚書袁侃等戒恕曰程申伯處先帝之世傾田園讓於青州足下今俱杖節使共屯一城宜深有以待之而恕不以為意至官未期有鮮卑大人兒不由關塞徑將數十騎詣州州斬所從來小子一人無表言上喜於是劾奏恕下廷尉當死以父畿勤事水死免為庶人徙章武郡是嵗嘉平元年","source_position":{"source_layer":"received_body","first_line":355,"last_line":365,"raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/sgz016-duji-dushu/fixed-complete-unit.json"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037:m0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"恕","kind":"person","person_id":"56f_8f7_e9f_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳子恕嗣、務伯及幽州刺史，與034杜預父恕幽州刺史/幽死為具體父子官履橋。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037:m0042","start":42,"end":43,"surface":"畿","kind":"person","person_id":"56f_8f7_e9f","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳伯侯、京兆杜陵及河東太守/尚書僕射，與已存荀彧薦畿、034祖畿魏尚書僕射同一近系；不把遠祖杜延年報告當已考證家系。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037:m0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"恕","kind":"person","person_id":"56f_8f7_e9f_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳子恕嗣、務伯及幽州刺史，與034杜預父恕幽州刺史/幽死為具體父子官履橋。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037:m0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"程喜","kind":"person","person_id":"a42_j01_n4k","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本章程申伯/程征北與青州田園讓事；已讀固定026田豫國讓及青州刺史程喜構陷之完整單元，確切共同事件而非同名猜。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037:m0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"袁侃","kind":"person","person_id":"ev9_lyp_ry2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"杜恕同班黃門袁侃轉吏部郎、後尚書袁侃戒恕，與已有袁侃魏人同官年代可連，保各來源署名。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037:m0101","start":101,"end":102,"surface":"恕","kind":"person","person_id":"56f_8f7_e9f_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳子恕嗣、務伯及幽州刺史，與034杜預父恕幽州刺史/幽死為具體父子官履橋。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037:m0103","start":103,"end":106,"surface":"程申伯","kind":"person","person_id":"a42_j01_n4k","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本章程申伯/程征北與青州田園讓事；已讀固定026田豫國讓及青州刺史程喜構陷之完整單元，確切共同事件而非同名猜。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037:m0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"先帝","kind":"person","person_id":"932_46f_026","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"太和散騎黃門侍郎杜恕疏及明帝崩為曹叡；長疏陛下受話人同此，後嘉平段先帝回指曹叡，不以最近宣王配。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037:m0112","start":112,"end":115,"surface":"田園讓","kind":"person","person_id":"f19_165_168","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"收到田園讓原字保；固定026明田豫字國讓、督青州遭程喜譖與此先帝時傾田園讓於青州同事，對已有026/028田豫重用。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037:m0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"足下","kind":"person","person_id":"56f_8f7_e9f_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳子恕嗣、務伯及幽州刺史，與034杜預父恕幽州刺史/幽死為具體父子官履橋。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037:m0136","start":136,"end":137,"surface":"恕","kind":"person","person_id":"56f_8f7_e9f_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳子恕嗣、務伯及幽州刺史，與034杜預父恕幽州刺史/幽死為具體父子官履橋。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit037:m0146","start":146,"end":15